    "details": "<p>What if your AI could step onto the pitch and outplay its opponent?</p>\n<p>Conv-Cup &rsquo;26: FIFA of AI is a fun, beginner-friendly AI competition where you build an autonomous football agent and put it to the test in a deterministic 2D soccer arena.</p>\n<p>Your AI will have to move, chase the ball, navigate obstacles, intercept opponents, make smart kicks, defend its goal, and&mdash;most importantly&mdash;score!</p>\n<p><strong>Format:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Team Size: 2&ndash;4 Participants</li>\n<li>1 Core Problem Statement: Build an Ai Soccer Agent</li>\n<li>Develop and Test Your Agent Using the Provided Simulator</li>\n<li>Submit Your Agent for Head-To-Head Evaluation Matches</li>\n<li>Matches Use Different Random Seeds and Obstacle Layouts</li>\n<li>Final Results Are Determined by Goals Scored</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rules:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>All Teams Use the Same Game Engine and Fixed Parameters</li>\n<li>Agents May Act only Through the Prescribed Interface</li>\n<li>Direct Modification of The Simulator/game State Is Prohibited</li>\n<li>External Ap Is Are Not Allowed</li>\n<li>Hidden Seeds May Be Used During Evaluation</li>\n<li>Attempts to Manipulate the Evaluation System May Result in Disqualification</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Eligibility:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Teams of 2&ndash;4</li>\n<li>Open to all</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Prizes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>₹6,000 &nbsp;| &nbsp; ₹3,000 &nbsp;| &nbsp; ₹1,500</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Think. Code. Compete. Score.</p>",
